<title>USA: Iowa-S Minn fed cattle not well tested - USDA.</title>
<headline>Iowa-S Minn fed cattle not well tested - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>DES MOINES 1997-05-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Steers and heifers were not tested on a live basis, compared with Friday's close, USDA said. On a carcass basis, steers and heifers were not well</p>
<p>establlished.</p>
<p>Steers:  Select to mostly Choice 2-4 1250 lbs ld 111.00</p>
<p>Heifers: Select to mostly Choice 2-4 1150 lbs ld 111.00</p>
<p>Reported sales for Monday: 100   Week to Date: 800</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312-408-8720))</p>
